  "description": "This Building Block proposes a schema representation of the OpenEO process [`text_ends`](https://processes.openeo.org/#text_ends) \u2014 *Text ends with another text*. It models the `arguments` object of a process graph node invoking `text_ends`. This is a proposed correspondence between the OpenEO process definition and an OGC Building Block schema, not a settled equivalence.\n\nChecks whether the text (also known as *string*) specified for `data` contains the text specified for `pattern` at the end. No-data values are passed through.\n\n## Source\n\nOpenEO Processes specification: [`text_ends`](https://processes.openeo.org/#text_ends) ([openeo-processes/text_ends.json at 2.0.0-rc.2](https://github.com/Open-EO/openeo-processes/blob/2.0.0-rc.2/text_ends.json)).\n",
